spec: S39-06

`avatar set | clear | show` for @scribe (profile `agent`), left without an avatar at the end. Text
is `@handle TYPE SIZE STATIC`, `@handle none` without one, `@handle cleared` after a clear. An
unchanged set or a clear of nothing is a note and exit 0. Every exit path: 1 (a file that cannot be
read, a refused image), 2 (unknown Member), 3 (no credential), 4 (another Member's, not an owner), 5
(over the cap), 6 (unreachable). Merged stdout+stderr.

```console
$ annotary -p agent avatar show
@scribe	none

$ ANNOTARY_TTY=1 NO_COLOR=1 annotary -p agent avatar
@scribe  none

$ annotary -p agent avatar set scribe.svg --static scribe.png
@scribe	image/svg+xml	2 KB	image/png

$ annotary -p agent avatar set scribe.svg --static scribe.png
@scribe's avatar is unchanged
@scribe	image/svg+xml	2 KB	image/png

$ ANNOTARY_TTY=1 NO_COLOR=1 annotary -p agent avatar show
@scribe  image/svg+xml  2 KB  image/png

$ annotary -p rowan avatar show @scribe --json handle,type,static_type
{"handle":"scribe","type":"image/svg+xml","static_type":"image/png"}

$ annotary -p agent avatar set linter.svg --json handle,type,changed
{"handle":"scribe","type":"image/svg+xml","changed":true}

$ annotary -p agent avatar show
@scribe	image/svg+xml	2 KB	-

$ annotary -p agent avatar set missing.png
? 1
error: cannot read missing.png: No such file or directory (os error 2)

$ annotary -p agent avatar set evil.svg
? 1
error: the avatar: the <script> element is not allowed — an avatar is a PNG, JPEG, GIF, WebP or a plain SVG (shapes, gradients, CSS animation; no scripts, links or outside files)

$ annotary -p agent avatar set scribe.svg --static scribe.svg
? 1
error: the static avatar: the static fallback must be a PNG, JPEG or WebP (an SVG or GIF may move) — an avatar is a PNG, JPEG, GIF, WebP or a plain SVG (shapes, gradients, CSS animation; no scripts, links or outside files)

$ sh big.sh

$ annotary -p agent avatar set big.png
? 5
error: big.png is 293 KB — the cap is 256 KB — avatars: an image up to 256 KB (an SVG up to 64 KB), a static fallback up to 256 KB

$ annotary -p limited avatar clear --member scribe
? 4
error: clearing another Member's avatar is owner-only — ask an owner (`annotary member list` shows who)

$ annotary -p rowan avatar clear --member nobody
? 2
error: no Member @nobody — `annotary member list` shows who

$ annotary -p rowan avatar show nobody
? 2
error: no Member @nobody — `annotary member list` shows who

$ annotary avatar show
? 3
error: no credential — say who you are: pass -p NAME (`annotary profile list` shows whose each one is), or set ANNOTARY_TOKEN
profiles in ~/.annotary/config.toml: agent, down, limited, pw, rowan

$ annotary -p down avatar show
? 6
error: server at http://127.0.0.1:1 not reachable — run `annotary serve` or `annotary daemon install`

$ annotary -p rowan avatar clear --member @scribe --json
{"handle":"scribe","changed":true}

$ annotary -p agent avatar clear
@scribe had no avatar
@scribe	none

$ ANNOTARY_TTY=1 NO_COLOR=1 annotary -p agent avatar set scribe.svg
@scribe  image/svg+xml  2 KB  -

$ ANNOTARY_TTY=1 NO_COLOR=1 annotary -p agent avatar clear
@scribe  cleared

$ annotary -p agent avatar clear --json
@scribe had no avatar
{"handle":"scribe"}

```
